","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h4>Cryptanalysis</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://www.cs.technion.ac.il/users/wwwb/cgi-bin/tr-info.cgi/2006/PHD/PHD-2006-04\">Cryptanalysis of block ciphers and protocols</a> - By Elad Pinhas Barkan.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-05T11:44:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h4>Cryptanalysis</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://www.cs.bc.edu/~straubin/crypto2017/heys.pdf\">Intro to Linear &#x26; Differential Cryptanalysis</a> - A beginner-friendly paper explaining and demonstrating techniques for linear and differential cryptanalysis.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-05T11:44:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h3>Books</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://crypto.stanford.edu/~dabo/cryptobook/\">A Graduate Course in Applied Cryptography</a> - By Dan Boneh and Victor Shoup. A well-balanced introductory course into cryptography, a bit of cryptanalysis and cryptography-related security.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-05T11:44:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h3>Books</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.esat.kuleuven.be/cosic/publications/thesis-16.pdf\">Analysis and design of cryptographic hash functions, MAC algorithms and block ciphers</a> - Broad overview of design and cryptanalysis of various ciphers and hash functions, by Bart Van Rompay.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-05T11:44:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"szenergy/awesome-lidar","categoryHTML":"<h2>Algorithms</h2><h3>Semantic segmentation</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1711.09869.pdf\">SuperPoint Graph 📰</a>- Large-scale Point Cloud Semantic Segmentation with Superpoint Graphs\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PRBonn/LiDAR-MOS\">GitHub repository :octocat:</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/PRBonn/LiDAR-MOS\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: 